* ADG711 Analog Switch Circuit

* 5V Single Supply
Vdd VDD 0 5

* 2V DC Input
Vin IN 0 2

* Control line driven to 0V (Logic Low) to close the ADG711 switch (Normally Closed)
Vctrl ctrl 0 0

* ADG711 Analog Switch Instance
* Standard LTspice ADI switch pinout: D S IN VDD GND
X1 OUT IN ctrl VDD 0 ADG711

* 10k Load Resistor
Rload OUT 0 10k

* Transient analysis to measure settled DC output
.tran 1m

.end
